rning this one.", "id": 2, "time": "25000", "image": "engenn6le08ob11re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: This is nice, you've got to keep it. What are those in that bag?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh, those are some cushions for my room, have a look.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'm coming over once this room is finished! It will be the most comfortable ever! Now, let's get painting!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Uh, I need to have some caffeine first. Hey, have you heard from Peter?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: He's waiting to hear from that PR place.", "id": 3, "time": "51000", "image": "engenn6le08ob11re2img02.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le08ob11re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le08ob11re2img06.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}